sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Project member
    participant A as API
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    U->>A: Check citation with answer, chunk, version, quote and hash
    A->>D: Verify membership and load scoped answer
    A->>D: Load chunk and exact excerpt from immutable version
    D-->>A: Stored range, content, hash and current version
    A->>A: Match run context, excerpt and stored offsets
    A-->>U: Integrity and current or historical freshness
